{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Ruby is a ",["l","矿物","Mineral"]," that can be obtained from ",["l","采矿#Ruby Node","Ruby Node"],"s and ",["l","采矿#Gem Node","Gem Node"],"s in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," (Floors 80+), ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],", and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],". After reaching the bottom of the Mines, Ruby Nodes can be found on any floor. A Ruby can also be obtained from ",["l","矮人哨兵","Dwarvish Sentries"]," (10% chance), in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],", by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],", or as a gift at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". It can be found in ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","crates and barrels"]," in the Mines (Floors 80+), Skull Cavern, and Volcano Dungeon. It may also occasionally be found in a ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," after the player has reached the bottom of the Mines."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Ruby is one of the options for the treasure hunter Bundle."]]]],["Forging",2,[["p",["Ruby can be used at the ",["l","锻造","Forge"]," to increase the damage of a melee weapon."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Ruby is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Ruby is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," with ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," in the feed to create a ",["l","裁缝","Shirt"],". It is a red dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed. It can also be placed in the red dye pot at ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],", for use in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Ruby may be randomly requested during any season at the ",["l","任务#Help Wanted Quests","\"Help Wanted\" board"]," outside ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]," for a reward of 750g and 150 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points. The Ruby will never be requested until the player has reached floors 80+ of ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],"."]],[1,["Ruby will be requested by ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," as part of the \"Rock Rejuvenation\" quest at the ",["l","任务#List of Special Orders","Special Orders"]," board outside Mayor ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],"' house."]],[1,["May be used in the ",["l","姜岛#Gem Birds","Gem Birds"]," puzzle on Ginger Island."]]]]]],["Trading",2,[["p",["One Ruby can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","香辣鳗鱼","Spicy Eel"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be traded to the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can be requested in a ",["l","任务#List of Special Orders","Special Order quest"],". Can now be used in ",["l","锻造","Forging"],". Also used in ",["l","姜岛#Gem Birds","Gem Birds puzzle"],". Is now an option in the Treasure Hunter's Bundle. Can now be obtained from the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," and Dwarvish Sentries."]]]]]]]}